{"id":"ambulancia","lemma":"ambulancia","pos":"noun","rank":1562,"glosses":["ambulance (an emergency vehicle designed for transporting seriously ill or injured people to a hospital)"],"ipa":"/ambuˈlanθja/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"ambulancias"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/15/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-ambulancia.wav","examples":[{"text":"Llama a una ambulancia.","en":"Call an ambulance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/444162"},{"text":"Las ambulancias llevaron a los heridos al hospital más cercano.","en":"The ambulances carried the injured to the nearest hospital."},{"text":"Llamen a una ambulancia.","en":"Call an ambulance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/79064"},{"text":"Llamé a una ambulancia.","en":"I called an ambulance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586022"},{"text":"Llamaré a una ambulancia.","en":"I'll call an ambulance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460890"}]}